// ---- Mesa passthrough declarations -----------------------------------------
// __real_X is the archive symbol; --wrap turns references to X into __wrap_X
// and references to __real_X back into X.

// One C-linkage stub for every string-only name the engine asks for. AArch64
// leaves 0 in x0, which is the safe answer for the query entry points and
// harmless for the void ones. The engine never NULL-checks these pointers
// (GL_SURFACE_REPORT.md 3.3), so handing back a real address is the whole job.
// Global scope on purpose: extern "C" does not belong in a namespace.
extern "C" void gfxGenericProcStub(void) {}

